        "headline": "Winter Weather Advisory issued June 28 at 11:14AM AKDT until June 29 at 10:00PM AKDT by NWS Fairbanks AK",
        "description": "* WHAT...A wintry mix is expected. Freezing rain accumulations are\npossible between a trace to around a tenth of an inch. Light snow\naccumulations are also possible Sunday night into Monday morning.\n\n* WHERE...Kaktovik and Point Thomson.\n\n* WHEN...From 10 PM Sunday to 10 PM AKDT Monday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel could become difficult at times.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...Temperatures are expected to fluctuate around\nfreezing from Sunday night through Monday morning, influencing\nprecipitation type. By Tue",
